# --- Quartus Compilation & Database (Recursive) ---
**/db/
**/incremental_db/
**/output_files/
**/greybox_tmp/
**/hps_isw_handoff/
**/.qsys_edit/

# --- Platform Designer (Qsys) Generated Files ---
# We keep the .qsys and .ip files, but ignore the massive synthesis folders
**/synthesis/
**/simulation/
**/submodules/
**/ip/

# --- Software / Nios V / Eclipse / CMake ---
# Ignore the workspace metadata and build artifacts
**/.metadata/
**/.plugins/
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeScratch/
**/pkgRedirects/
**/.indexes/
**/build/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
*.elf
*.objdump
*.hex
*.map
*.stack_report
.safetable

# --- Python Tools ---
# If your 'qpd visualizer' generates bytecode or virtual environments
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/

# --- Temporary & Backup Files ---
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.rpt
*.summary
*.jdi
*.pin
*.done
*.qws
*.txt
*.log